RunInfo: >
  Requires zero-polarization 160 GeV mu+ p and mu+ n samples, with POSNLO
  and NEGNLO generated separately.
NumEvents: 100000
NeedsCrossSection: yes
Beams: [[ANTIMUON, PROTON], [ANTIMUON, NEUTRON]]
Energies: [[160.0, 0.938272], [160.0, 0.939565]]
Description: >
  Fills event-aggregated antiproton/proton and K-/K+ yields and same-event
  covariance proxies in all 67 paper-table cells. The postprocessor adds
  signed-NLO normalized bins, forms the isoscalar P/N sum, and only then takes
  the negative/positive ratio. Paper TeX/PDF are the numerical authority;
  no official HEPData submission was available on 2026-08-28.
